{"data":[{"author_id":"1400012445154889731","created_at":"2026-10-28T14:48:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115455546480607388"],"id":"2115455546480607388","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":17379,"like_count":37,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":1},"text":"2026币圈全年资产涨跌幅排名\n\n。。。。。 https://t.co/IDAwwYg9zp","url":"https://x.com/DtDt666/status/2115455546480607388"},{"author_id":"8149482","created_at":"2026-10-28T14:45:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115454899328590065"],"id":"2115454899328590065","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":27,"impression_count":72648,"like_count":232,"quote_count":14,"reply_count":42,"retweet_count":29},"text":"【更新：西班牙高铁追尾惨剧  至少64人死亡】 \n10月28日，西班牙中部发生严重的高铁相撞事故。两列车共载约544名乘客。目前至少64人死亡，约179人受伤。  \n是该线路今年第二起重大事故。今年1月，一列列车脱轨后撞上迎面驶来的另一列列车致45人死亡。事故动摇了西班牙民众对本国高铁网的信心。 https://t.co/YBvBRGcNLk","url":"https://x.com/VOAChinese/status/2115454899328590065"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-28T14:40:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115453533428527407"],"id":"2115453533428527407","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":54,"impression_count":68962,"like_count":404,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":46},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114935117319909647","type":"quoted"}],"text":"“徽剑”遇害案家属称被迫签谅解书：两名壮汉曾上门闹事\n\n10月27日，反诈博主“徽剑”遇害案家属向时代周报表示，两名男子曾到家里闹事，把其父亲吓得够呛，最后才签署刑事谅解书：“其实被迫的，谁想要这个钱呢。” https://t.co/fnzYHvrxeT https://t.co/z4qZ0PzUOl","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2115453533428527407"},{"author_id":"1477342523555135490","created_at":"2026-10-28T14:39:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115453359780245622"],"id":"2115453359780245622","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":38770,"like_count":652,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":51,"retweet_count":10},"text":"如果你是个认可毛泽东的左派\n\n那你只能说是个假左派，或者是个缺乏认知的左派","url":"https://x.com/torontobigface/status/2115453359780245622"},{"author_id":"8149482","created_at":"2026-10-28T14:38:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115453162882544031"],"id":"2115453162882544031","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11643,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"以色列总统赫尔佐格28日称赞本周选举的投票率非常高并敦促政治领导人努力避免新一轮选举；目前各政党正准备进行组阁谈判。根据以色列法律，选举结果获得确认后总统将与各当选政党磋商，并指定一名议员、通常是被认为最有可能获得议会多数席位的政党领导人组建执政联盟。\n更多：https://t.co/ECDAYEUrc8 https://t.co/33k0gNRFh9","url":"https://x.com/VOAChinese/status/2115453162882544031"},{"author_id":"791197","created_at":"2026-10-28T14:32:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115451723372257736"],"id":"2115451723372257736","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":30596,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":4},"text":"事故发生在西班牙首都马德里以南的托莱多省，当时两列列车总共有超过500名乘客。\nhttps://t.co/r7Kpn7gqWD","url":"https://x.com/bbcchinese/status/2115451723372257736"},{"author_id":"46574977","created_at":"2026-10-28T14:30:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115451231032279512"],"id":"2115451231032279512","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":30,"impression_count":24447,"like_count":67,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":8},"text":"阅读量大得惊人，拿A也绝非易事。既然如此，为什么大一新生还争着选修“人文学科10”？\n\n学生们在申请材料和采访中表示，希望被逼着去读那些原本不会去读的经典，需要应对注意力日渐涣散的问题，也想找到一剂抵御机器侵蚀的解药。https://t.co/Nya9moXeak","url":"https://x.com/ChineseWSJ/status/2115451231032279512"},{"author_id":"143810986","created_at":"2026-10-28T14:20:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115448696208871808"],"id":"2115448696208871808","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":25,"impression_count":41540,"like_count":333,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":120,"retweet_count":23},"text":"姆巴佩疑不点名地称毛泽东为\"独裁者\"而遭中国企业解约、央视封杀。\n体育资讯平台懂球帝在声明中，直言\"由于他的发言涉及对中国和中国人民的伤害，我们不能进行翻译\"。\n时事评论作家长平指出，毛泽东生前对\"独裁者\"之称\"一概承认\"，还嫌说得不够。 https://t.co/oylppYancz","url":"https://x.com/dw_chinese/status/2115448696208871808"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-28T14:20:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115448501790285845"],"id":"2115448501790285845","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":83,"impression_coun